## Model card

- **Name:** Claude Mythos 5.2
- **Short description:** Anthropic’s Claude Mythos 5.2 is the same underlying model as Claude Fable 5.2, available only to organizations verified through Anthropic’s verification programs for trusted defensive/security and related use cases.
- **Provider / access:** Anthropic via trusted/verified access programs (e.g. Cyber Verification Program); platform docs list model IDs across Anthropic-supported platforms. Local metadata lists `anthropic/claude-mythos-5.2` and `noFreeId`.
- **Release / knowledge:** Released November 9, 2026. Reliable knowledge cutoff June 2026; training data cutoff June 2026 (Anthropic platform docs).
- **IDs:** `claude-mythos-5-2`, `anthropic.claude-mythos-5-2` (platform-specific).
- **Context window:** 1M tokens context, 128K max output (Anthropic platform docs; same as Fable 5.2).
- **Modalities:** Text and image input; text output (Anthropic platform docs).
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-10):** $8 / 1M input tokens, $40 / 1M output tokens; cache read $0.20 / 1M, 5m cache write $10 / 1M, 1h cache write $16 / 1M, Batch API 50% discount (Anthropic platform docs).
- **Architecture:** Proprietary Anthropic model; architecture/parameter count not publicly disclosed.

